hou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0017","start":17,"end":21,"surface":"城陽王徽","kind":"person","person_id":"qev_v81_rkw","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"從駕河北功臣及後莊帝謀誅榮密議，爵名同上下文首選。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"李彧","kind":"person","person_id":"lv5_7r2_s37","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"與李晞城陽王徽預莊帝圖榮謀，具名職稱。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"尒朱兆","kind":"person","person_id":"nbh_vlu_zv2","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"榮部渡馬渚與後入洛，完整莊帝／榮事件承接。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0041","start":41,"end":42,"surface":"侃","kind":"person","person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"子侃正文停柩及襲華陰伯；下完整侃傳、同北史士業與裴邃／濟河／韋義遠事件。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0060","start":60,"end":62,"surface":"天光","kind":"person","person_id":"hhk_kr8_h9p","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"大都督西伐及普泰關西借韋義遠招侃後七月害之，同事主線。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0067","start":67,"end":68,"surface":"侃","kind":"person","person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"子侃正文停柩及襲華陰伯；下完整侃傳、同北史士業與裴邃／濟河／韋義遠事件。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"子婦","kind":"person","person_id":"rwe_ukz_s8s","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"子婦是侃未名兒子的妻，父韋義遠明；不指定其夫師沖或純陀。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0071","start":71,"end":74,"surface":"韋義遠","kind":"person","person_id":"x0d_y49_0ry","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"天光遣侃子婦父韋義遠招慰之，父關係只到該未名子婦，不推侃妻。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0085","start":85,"end":86,"surface":"侃","kind":"person","person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"子侃正文停柩及襲華陰伯；下完整侃傳、同北史士業與裴邃／濟河／韋義遠事件。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0088","start":88,"end":89,"surface":"昱","kind":"person","person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAABA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"侃從兄昱勸赴天光；本卷後椿子昱字元晷並父椿可供近系橋，本批僅同源從兄，不推共同祖父。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0095","start":95,"end":96,"surface":"侃","kind":"person","person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"子侃正文停柩及襲華陰伯；下完整侃傳、同北史士業與裴邃／濟河／韋義遠事件。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0113","start":113,"end":115,"surface":"百口","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","interpretation_note":"集合或未具名角色，不拆成一人、不補姓名或親屬。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0116","start":116,"end":117,"surface":"侃","kind":"person","person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"子侃正文停柩及襲華陰伯；下完整侃傳、同北史士業與裴邃／濟河／韋義遠事件。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0126","start":126,"end":128,"surface":"天光","kind":"person","person_id":"hhk_kr8_h9p","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"大都督西伐及普泰關西借韋義遠招侃後七月害之，同事主線。"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan:p014:m0152","start":152,"end":154,"surface":"純陀","kind":"person","person_id":"fum_370_iq6_AAAAAB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"侃傳末子純陀襲，明子與襲分開，不由繼爵單獨推父子。"}],"chapter_id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-yangkan","book_id":"b-weishu-weishou-058","work_id":"w-weishu-weishou","source_id":"s-weishu-weishou-058-yangbo-ws2087998"},{"id":"c-weishu-weishou-058-yangchun:p024","text":"孝莊還宮，還復前官。及父椿辭老，請解官從養，詔不許。尒朱榮之死也，昱為東道行臺，率眾拒尒朱仲遠。會尒朱兆入洛，昱還京師。後歸鄉里，亦為天光所害。太昌初，贈都督瀛定二州諸軍事、驃騎大將軍、司空公、定州刺史。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"in_progress","source_position":{"revision_id":2087998,"raw_start":9157,"raw_end":9259,"source_layer":"received_biography","raw_character_offsets":[9157,9158,9159,9160,9161,9162,9163,9164,9165,9166,9167,9168,9169,9170,9171,9172,9173,9174,9175,9176,9177,9178,9179,9180,9181,9182,9183,9184